# Compliance Management Module - Test Report

## Top 5 Critical Priority Test Cases
These test cases validate the core business logic, data persistence, and legal enforcement capabilities of the compliance engine.

| Test Case ID | Test Case Title | Test Description | Expected Result | Actual Result | Pass/Fail |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **TC-COMP-CRIT-01** | **End-to-End Violation Lifecycle & Persistence** | Identify an 'Open' violation (e.g., Critical severity). Transition status: 'Acknowledge' -> 'Escalate' or 'Resolve'. Hard-refresh the browser page. | Violation state transitions smoothly. Buttons disable based on logic (cannot escalate resolved issues). **State persists across page reloads.** | Status updated through lifecycle successfully, and data persisted accurately in localStorage after page refresh. UI buttons disabled appropriately. | **Pass** |
| **TC-COMP-CRIT-02** | **Metrics Calculation Accuracy** | Manually count the number of violations and compliant industries in the raw data, and compare it against the numbers shown in the 'Overview Cards' at the top. | The counts, percentages, and compliance score calculation exactly match the underlying database/local storage figures. | The calculated counts and overall compliance score (76.8%) mathematically match the raw dataset accurately. | **Pass** |
| **TC-COMP-CRIT-03** | **Bulk Enforcement (Missing Data)** | In the 'Missing Submissions' alert section, click the 'Send Bulk Reminder' button to notify non-compliant industries. | System triggers notifications to all pending industries. A success message confirms the action without system timeout or crashing. | Bulk notification logic triggered instantly; success confirmation snackbar appeared on screen. | **Pass** |
| **TC-COMP-CRIT-04** | **Data Export Integrity (CSV)** | Click 'Download Full Compliance Report' on the Predictions tab and 'Export List' on the Violations tab. Open the downloaded CSV files. | Both CSV files download successfully. Columns and rows map correctly without data corruption, missing fields, or encoding errors. | CSV downloaded successfully. Data is formatted correctly with proper headers ('Metric, Current, Projected 1yr, Growth') and all rows intact. | **Pass** |
| **TC-COMP-CRIT-05** | **Strict Filtering without Data Leakage** | Set Severity filter to 'Critical' and Status filter to 'Open'. Verify the resulting table rows. | The table *strictly* displays only Open and Critical violations. No other severities or statuses leak into the view. | Table correctly narrowed down to only show the specific Critical/Open issues. No other severities leaked into the view. | **Pass** |

